OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA grey start, with patchy light
OL,6,Frain and also murky conditions over
OL,7,Fthe hills. Turning brighter by
OL,8,Flunchtime with good spells of sunshine
OL,9,Fdeveloping although turning cloudier
OL,10,Fagain later in the southwest. Feeling
OL,11,Fwarm in the sunshine for late
OL,12,FSeptember.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FDry initially this evening,
OL,15,Fbut a band of heavy rain and strong
OL,16,Fwinds will quickly sweep across the
OL,17,Fcountry. Rain and winds easing later
OL,18,Fwith showers following. Remaining mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
