OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FShowers quickly becoming
OL,6,Fconfined to the far west on Wednesday
OL,7,Fleaving a largely dry and bright day.
OL,8,FA little cooler but still warm in the
OL,9,Fsunshine with winds also easing.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FLargely dry with sunny spells
OL,13,FThursday, before rain arrives Friday.
OL,14,FDrier and brighter Saturday once early
OL,15,Fmist and fog clears. Temperatures
OL,16,Freturning nearer to average for early
OL,17,FOctober.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
